[{"id":"nabbaa-6-108-21","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih obavještava","en":"so he/it informs them"},{"bs":"zar obavještavate?","en":"do you (all) inform?"},{"bs":"pa zaista ćemo obavijestiti","en":"so surely we will inform"},{"bs":"obavještava te","en":"he/it informs you"}],"ref":"6:108","answerWord":"فَيُنَبِّئُهُم","answerSound":"audio/87f97184997706e118ae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Revile not those unto whom they pray beside Allah lest they wrongfully revile Allah through ignorance. Thus unto every nation have We made their deed seem fair. Then unto their Lord is their return, and He will tell them what they used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَسُبُّوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَدْعُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَيَسُبُّوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","عَدْوًۢا","بِغَيْرِ","عِلْمٍ","كَذَٰلِكَ","زَيَّنَّا","لِكُلِّ","أُمَّةٍ","عَمَلَهُمْ","ثُمَّ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّهِم","مَّرْجِعُهُمْ","فَيُنَبِّئُهُم","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-5-60-2","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavještavam vas","en":"I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"obavijestio nas je","en":"he/it informed us"},{"bs":"da vas obavijestimo","en":"shall we inform you"},{"bs":"biva obaviješten","en":"he/it is informed"}],"ref":"5:60","answerWord":"أُنَبِّئُكُم","answerSound":"audio/d2110f59b8329dd45e9b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Shall I tell thee of a worse (case) than theirs for retribution with Allah? (Worse is the case of him) whom Allah hath cursed, him on whom His wrath hath fallen and of whose sort Allah hath turned some to apes and swine, and who serveth idols. Such are in worse plight and further astray from the plain road.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["قُلْ","هَلْ","أُنَبِّئُكُم","بِشَرٍّ","مِّن","ذَٰلِكَ","مَثُوبَةً","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","مَن","لَّعَنَهُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَغَضِبَ","عَلَيْهِ","وَجَعَلَ","مِنْهُمُ","ٱلْقِرَدَةَ","وَٱلْخَنَازِيرَ","وَعَبَدَ","ٱلطَّٰغُوتَ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","شَرٌّ","مَّكَانًا","وَأَضَلُّ","عَن","سَوَآءِ","ٱلسَّبِيلِ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-6-159-15","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavještava ih","en":"he/it informs them"},{"bs":"biva obaviješten","en":"he/it is informed"},{"bs":"zar obavještavate?","en":"do you (all) inform?"},{"bs":"obavijestio me je","en":"he/it informed me"}],"ref":"6:159","answerWord":"يُنَبِّئُهُم","answerSound":"audio/b2feaf0c15381ae3eec8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! As for those who sunder their religion and become schismatics, no concern at all hast thou with them. Their case will go to Allah, Who then will tell them what they used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","فَرَّقُوا۟","دِينَهُمْ","وَكَانُوا۟","شِيَعًا","لَّسْتَ","مِنْهُمْ","فِى","شَىْءٍ","إِنَّمَآ","أَمْرُهُمْ","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","ثُمَّ","يُنَبِّئُهُم","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْعَلُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-15-51-0","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i obavijesti ih!","en":"and inform them!"},{"bs":"zar vas obavještavam?","en":"do I inform you (all)?"},{"bs":"obavijestila je","en":"she/it informed"},{"bs":"obavijestio ju je","en":"he/it informed her"}],"ref":"15:51","answerWord":"وَنَبِّئْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/b4f08c05c8232cd35405.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And tell them of Abraham's guests,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَنَبِّئْهُمْ","عَن","ضَيْفِ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-29-8-17","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa vas obavještavam","en":"so I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"da vas obavijestimo","en":"shall we inform you"},{"bs":"zaista ćete biti obaviješteni","en":"surely you (all) will be informed"},{"bs":"obavijestio nas je","en":"he/it informed us"}],"ref":"29:8","answerWord":"فَأُنَبِّئُكُم","answerSound":"audio/fb52da5b2a20f341c7f5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We have enjoined on man kindness to parents; but if they strive to make thee join with Me that of which thou hast no knowledge, then obey them not. Unto Me is your return and I shall tell you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَوَصَّيْنَا","ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ","بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","حُسْنًا","وَإِن","جَٰهَدَاكَ","لِتُشْرِكَ","بِى","مَا","لَيْسَ","لَكَ","بِهِۦ","عِلْمٌ","فَلَا","تُطِعْهُمَآ","إِلَىَّ","مَرْجِعُكُمْ","فَأُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-3-15-1","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"zar vas obavještavam?","en":"do I inform you (all)?"},{"bs":"obavještava vas","en":"he/it informs you (all)"},{"bs":"zar obavještavate?","en":"do you (all) inform?"},{"bs":"obavijestila je","en":"she/it informed"}],"ref":"3:15","answerWord":"أَؤُنَبِّئُكُم","answerSound":"audio/ee96f56f42515d667ddb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Shall I inform you of something better than that? For those who keep from evil, with their Lord, are Gardens underneath which rivers flow wherein they will abide, and pure companions, and contentment from Allah. Allah is Seer of His bondmen,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَؤُنَبِّئُكُم","بِخَيْرٍ","مِّن","ذَٰلِكُمْ","لِلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوْا۟","عِندَ","رَبِّهِمْ","جَنَّٰتٌ","تَجْرِى","مِن","تَحْتِهَا","ٱلْأَنْهَٰرُ","خَٰلِدِينَ","فِيهَا","وَأَزْوَٰجٌ","مُّطَهَّرَةٌ","وَرِضْوَٰنٌ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","بَصِيرٌۢ","بِٱلْعِبَادِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-5-14-20","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavještava ih","en":"he/it informs them"},{"bs":"zaista ćete biti obaviješteni","en":"surely you (all) will be informed"},{"bs":"biva obaviješten","en":"he/it is informed"},{"bs":"obavijesti!","en":"inform!"}],"ref":"5:14","answerWord":"يُنَبِّئُهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/537c21c0f5dd1502e5b0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And with those who say: \"Lo! we are Christians,\" We made a covenant, but they forgot a part of that whereof they were admonished. Therefor We have stirred up enmity and hatred among them till the Day of Resurrection, when Allah will inform them of their handiwork.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّا","نَصَٰرَىٰٓ","أَخَذْنَا","مِيثَٰقَهُمْ","فَنَسُوا۟","حَظًّا","مِّمَّا","ذُكِّرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَأَغْرَيْنَا","بَيْنَهُمُ","ٱلْعَدَاوَةَ","وَٱلْبَغْضَآءَ","إِلَىٰ","يَوْمِ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","وَسَوْفَ","يُنَبِّئُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَصْنَعُونَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-6-60-18","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavještava vas","en":"he/it informs you (all)"},{"bs":"i obavještavam vas","en":"and I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"obavijestit ću te","en":"I will inform you"},{"bs":"pa ih obavještavamo","en":"so we inform them"}],"ref":"6:60","answerWord":"يُنَبِّئُكُم","answerSound":"audio/82eb8fea15dc55aec106.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who gathereth you at night and knoweth that which ye commit by day. Then He raiseth you again to life therein, that the term appointed (for you) may be accomplished. And afterward unto Him is your return. Then He will proclaim unto you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","بِٱلَّيْلِ","وَيَعْلَمُ","مَا","جَرَحْتُم","بِٱلنَّهَارِ","ثُمَّ","يَبْعَثُكُمْ","فِيهِ","لِيُقْضَىٰٓ","أَجَلٌ","مُّسَمًّى","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْهِ","مَرْجِعُكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-6-143-18","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijestite me!","en":"(you all) inform me!"},{"bs":"obavijestio me je","en":"he/it informed me"},{"bs":"obavještavam vas","en":"I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"i obavijesti ih!","en":"and inform them!"}],"ref":"6:143","answerWord":"نَبِّـُٔونِى","answerSound":"audio/74e9a8457f204cacb806.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Eight pairs: Of the sheep twain, and of the goats twain. Say: Hath He forbidden the two males or the two females, or that which the wombs of the two females contain? Expound to me (the case) with knowledge, if ye are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["ثَمَٰنِيَةَ","أَزْوَٰجٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلضَّأْنِ","ٱثْنَيْنِ","وَمِنَ","ٱلْمَعْزِ","ٱثْنَيْنِ","قُلْ","ءَآلذَّكَرَيْنِ","حَرَّمَ","أَمِ","ٱلْأُنثَيَيْنِ","أَمَّا","ٱشْتَمَلَتْ","عَلَيْهِ","أَرْحَامُ","ٱلْأُنثَيَيْنِ","نَبِّـُٔونِى","بِعِلْمٍ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-9-94-12","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijestio nas je","en":"he/it informed us"},{"bs":"biva obaviješten","en":"he/it is informed"},{"bs":"pa ih obavještavamo","en":"so we inform them"},{"bs":"pa ih obavještava","en":"so he/it informs them"}],"ref":"9:94","answerWord":"نَبَّأَنَا","answerSound":"audio/011dd0ba27ccacc53f97.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will make excuse to you (Muslims) when ye return unto them. Say: Make no excuse, for we shall not believe you. Allah hath told us tidings of you. Allah and His messenger will see your conduct, and then ye will be brought back unto Him Who knoweth the Invisible as well as the Visible, and He will tell you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["يَعْتَذِرُونَ","إِلَيْكُمْ","إِذَا","رَجَعْتُمْ","إِلَيْهِمْ","قُل","لَّا","تَعْتَذِرُوا۟","لَن","نُّؤْمِنَ","لَكُمْ","قَدْ","نَبَّأَنَا","ٱللَّهُ","مِنْ","أَخْبَارِكُمْ","وَسَيَرَى","ٱللَّهُ","عَمَلَكُمْ","وَرَسُولُهُۥ","ثُمَّ","تُرَدُّونَ","إِلَىٰ","عَٰلِمِ","ٱلْغَيْبِ","وَٱلشَّهَٰدَةِ","فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-10-18-15","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"zar obavještavate?","en":"do you (all) inform?"},{"bs":"obavještavate ga","en":"you (all) inform him"},{"bs":"obavještavam vas","en":"I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"obavještava ih","en":"he/it informs them"}],"ref":"10:18","answerWord":"أَتُنَبِّـُٔونَ","answerSound":"audio/8f684a65743176337569.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They worship beside Allah that which neither hurteth them nor profiteth them, and they say: These are our intercessors with Allah. Say: Would ye inform Allah of (something) that He knoweth not in the heavens or in the earth? Praised be He and High Exalted above all that ye associate (with Him)!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَيَعْبُدُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَا","يَضُرُّهُمْ","وَلَا","يَنفَعُهُمْ","وَيَقُولُونَ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","شُفَعَٰٓؤُنَا","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","قُلْ","أَتُنَبِّـُٔونَ","ٱللَّهَ","بِمَا","لَا","يَعْلَمُ","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَلَا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","سُبْحَٰنَهُۥ","وَتَعَٰلَىٰ","عَمَّا","يُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-10-23-21","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa vas obavještavamo","en":"so we inform you (all)"},{"bs":"zar vas obavještavam?","en":"do I inform you (all)?"},{"bs":"obavještava vas","en":"he/it informs you (all)"},{"bs":"obavijestio nas je","en":"he/it informed us"}],"ref":"10:23","answerWord":"فَنُنَبِّئُكُم","answerSound":"audio/d8b9f24a16799d8e1f29.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Yet when He hath delivered them, behold! they rebel in the earth wrongfully. O mankind! Your rebellion is only against yourselves. (Ye have) enjoyment of the life of the world; then unto Us is your return and We shall proclaim unto you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["فَلَمَّآ","أَنجَىٰهُمْ","إِذَا","هُمْ","يَبْغُونَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","بِغَيْرِ","ٱلْحَقِّ","يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","إِنَّمَا","بَغْيُكُمْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِكُم","مَّتَٰعَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْنَا","مَرْجِعُكُمْ","فَنُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-12-36-21","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijesti nas!","en":"inform us!"},{"bs":"obavještava vas","en":"he/it informs you (all)"},{"bs":"obavijestio sam vas","en":"I informed you (two)"},{"bs":"i obavještavam vas","en":"and I inform you (all)"}],"ref":"12:36","answerWord":"نَبِّئْنَا","answerSound":"audio/415de91c51c69f55db0b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And two young men went to prison with him. One of them said: I dreamed that I was pressing wine. The other said: I dreamed that I was carrying upon my head bread whereof the birds were eating. Announce unto us the interpretation, for we see thee of those good (at interpretation).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَدَخَلَ","مَعَهُ","ٱلسِّجْنَ","فَتَيَانِ","قَالَ","أَحَدُهُمَآ","إِنِّىٓ","أَرَىٰنِىٓ","أَعْصِرُ","خَمْرًا","وَقَالَ","ٱلْءَاخَرُ","إِنِّىٓ","أَرَىٰنِىٓ","أَحْمِلُ","فَوْقَ","رَأْسِى","خُبْزًا","تَأْكُلُ","ٱلطَّيْرُ","مِنْهُ","نَبِّئْنَا","بِتَأْوِيلِهِۦٓ","إِنَّا","نَرَىٰكَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-12-37-6","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijestio sam vas","en":"I informed you (two)"},{"bs":"obavještavam vas","en":"I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"obavještava ih","en":"he/it informs them"},{"bs":"obavještava te","en":"he/it informs you"}],"ref":"12:37","answerWord":"نَبَّأْتُكُمَا","answerSound":"audio/20e45f606876a5b01124.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: The food which ye are given (daily) shall not come unto you but I shall tell you the interpretation ere it cometh unto you. This is of that which my Lord hath taught me. Lo! I have forsaken the religion of folk who believe not in Allah and are disbelievers in the Hereafter.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["قَالَ","لَا","يَأْتِيكُمَا","طَعَامٌ","تُرْزَقَانِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","نَبَّأْتُكُمَا","بِتَأْوِيلِهِۦ","قَبْلَ","أَن","يَأْتِيَكُمَا","ذَٰلِكُمَا","مِمَّا","عَلَّمَنِى","رَبِّىٓ","إِنِّى","تَرَكْتُ","مِلَّةَ","قَوْمٍ","لَّا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَهُم","بِٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","هُمْ","كَٰفِرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-15-49-0","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijesti!","en":"inform!"},{"bs":"obavještavam vas","en":"I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"obavještava te","en":"he/it informs you"},{"bs":"obavijestite me!","en":"(you all) inform me!"}],"ref":"15:49","answerWord":"نَبِّئْ","answerSound":"audio/d31e2544af6d4a7e84b0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Announce, (O Muhammad) unto My slaves that verily I am the Forgiving, the Merciful,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["نَبِّئْ","عِبَادِىٓ","أَنِّىٓ","أَنَا","ٱلْغَفُورُ","ٱلرَّحِيمُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-18-78-5","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavijestit ću te","en":"I will inform you"},{"bs":"zar vas obavještavam?","en":"do I inform you (all)?"},{"bs":"zar obavještavate?","en":"do you (all) inform?"},{"bs":"biva obaviješten","en":"he/it is informed"}],"ref":"18:78","answerWord":"سَأُنَبِّئُكَ","answerSound":"audio/a22885d4d39fbdab3a66.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: This is the parting between thee and me! I will announce unto thee the interpretation of that thou couldst not bear with patience.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["قَالَ","هَٰذَا","فِرَاقُ","بَيْنِى","وَبَيْنِكَ","سَأُنَبِّئُكَ","بِتَأْوِيلِ","مَا","لَمْ","تَسْتَطِع","عَّلَيْهِ","صَبْرًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-18-103-2","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"da vas obavijestimo","en":"shall we inform you"},{"bs":"obavještava ih","en":"he/it informs them"},{"bs":"biva obaviješten","en":"he/it is informed"},{"bs":"obavještavam vas","en":"I inform you (all)"}],"ref":"18:103","answerWord":"نُنَبِّئُكُم","answerSound":"audio/f306c33e43f8913bfee7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Shall We inform you who will be the greatest losers by their works?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["قُلْ","هَلْ","نُنَبِّئُكُم","بِٱلْأَخْسَرِينَ","أَعْمَٰلًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-26-221-1","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavještavam vas","en":"I inform you (all)"},{"bs":"zar obavještavate?","en":"do you (all) inform?"},{"bs":"zaista ćete biti obaviješteni","en":"surely you (all) will be informed"},{"bs":"obavještava te","en":"he/it informs you"}],"ref":"26:221","answerWord":"أُنَبِّئُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/47831e59558fea3a7824.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Shall I inform you upon whom the devils descend?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["هَلْ","أُنَبِّئُكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","مَن","تَنَزَّلُ","ٱلشَّيَٰطِينُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-31-23-7","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih obavještavamo","en":"so we inform them"},{"bs":"obavijestio sam vas","en":"I informed you (two)"},{"bs":"zar vas obavještavam?","en":"do I inform you (all)?"},{"bs":"biva obaviješten","en":"he/it is informed"}],"ref":"31:23","answerWord":"فَنُنَبِّئُهُم","answerSound":"audio/749e061d6061eaaffff9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whosoever disbelieveth, let not his disbelief afflict thee (O Muhammad). Unto Us is their return, and We shall tell them what they did. Lo! Allah is Aware of what is in the breasts (of men).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَمَن","كَفَرَ","فَلَا","يَحْزُنكَ","كُفْرُهُۥٓ","إِلَيْنَا","مَرْجِعُهُمْ","فَنُنَبِّئُهُم","بِمَا","عَمِلُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِذَاتِ","ٱلصُّدُورِ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"nabbaa-34-7-7","words":["verb:nabbaa"],"options":[{"bs":"obavještava vas","en":"he/it informs you (all)"},{"bs":"obavijesti!","en":"inform!"},{"bs":"obavještava te","en":"he/it informs you"},{"bs":"obavijestio ju je","en":"he/it informed her"}],"ref":"34:7","answerWord":"يُنَبِّئُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/cf26fa3f0f260564b419.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who disbelieve say: Shall we show you a man who will tell you (that) when ye have become dispersed in dust with most complete dispersal still, even then, ye will be created anew?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"obavijestiti, obznaniti","en":"to inform, to tell"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","هَلْ","نَدُلُّكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","رَجُلٍ","يُنَبِّئُكُمْ","إِذَا","مُزِّقْتُمْ","كُلَّ","مُمَزَّقٍ","إِنَّكُمْ","لَفِى","خَلْقٍ","جَدِيدٍ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَّأَ"}},{"id":"hajja-3-65-3","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"prepirete se","en":"you (all) argue"},{"bs":"zar se raspravljate sa mnom?","en":"do you (all) argue with me?"},{"bs":"i prepirao se s njim","en":"and he/it argued with him"},{"bs":"da se prepiru s vama","en":"so that they may argue with you (all)"}],"ref":"3:65","answerWord":"تُحَآجُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/eede0ed8de15d75e7b11.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O People of the Scripture! Why will ye argue about Abraham, when the Torah and the Gospel were not revealed till after him? Have ye then no sense?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَهْلَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لِمَ","تُحَآجُّونَ","فِىٓ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","وَمَآ","أُنزِلَتِ","ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةُ","وَٱلْإِنجِيلُ","إِلَّا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦٓ","أَفَلَا","تَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"hajja-2-76-17","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"da se prepiru s vama","en":"so that they may argue with you (all)"},{"bs":"prepirao se","en":"he/it argued"},{"bs":"prepiru se","en":"they argue"},{"bs":"prepirao se s tobom","en":"he/it argued with you"}],"ref":"2:76","answerWord":"لِيُحَآجُّوكُم","answerSound":"audio/e9348c2375e38fa97709.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they fall in with those who believe, they say: We believe. But when they go apart one with another they say: Prate ye to them of that which Allah hath disclosed to you that they may contend with you before your Lord concerning it? Have ye then no sense?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","لَقُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَإِذَا","خَلَا","بَعْضُهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","بَعْضٍ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَتُحَدِّثُونَهُم","بِمَا","فَتَحَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْكُمْ","لِيُحَآجُّوكُم","بِهِۦ","عِندَ","رَبِّكُمْ","أَفَلَا","تَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"hajja-2-139-1","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"zar se prepirete s nama?","en":"do you (all) argue with us?"},{"bs":"zar se raspravljate sa mnom?","en":"do you (all) argue with me?"},{"bs":"prepirao se","en":"he/it argued"},{"bs":"prepirete se","en":"you (all) argue"}],"ref":"2:139","answerWord":"أَتُحَآجُّونَنَا","answerSound":"audio/b9b706dafe7b838c1cb6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (unto the People of the Scripture): Dispute ye with us concerning Allah when He is our Lord and your Lord? Ours are our works and yours your works. We look to Him alone.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَتُحَآجُّونَنَا","فِى","ٱللَّهِ","وَهُوَ","رَبُّنَا","وَرَبُّكُمْ","وَلَنَآ","أَعْمَٰلُنَا","وَلَكُمْ","أَعْمَٰلُكُمْ","وَنَحْنُ","لَهُۥ","مُخْلِصُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"hajja-3-61-1","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"prepirao se s tobom","en":"he/it argued with you"},{"bs":"da se prepiru s vama","en":"so that they may argue with you (all)"},{"bs":"zar se raspravljate sa mnom?","en":"do you (all) argue with me?"},{"bs":"prepirali su se s tobom","en":"they argued with you"}],"ref":"3:61","answerWord":"حَآجَّكَ","answerSound":"audio/7d4e312529b037565fef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso disputeth with thee concerning him, after the knowledge which hath come unto thee, say (unto him): Come! We will summon our sons and your sons, and our women and your women, and ourselves and yourselves, then we will pray humbly (to our Lord) and (solemnly) invoke the curse of Allah upon those who lie.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["فَمَنْ","حَآجَّكَ","فِيهِ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","جَآءَكَ","مِنَ","ٱلْعِلْمِ","فَقُلْ","تَعَالَوْا۟","نَدْعُ","أَبْنَآءَنَا","وَأَبْنَآءَكُمْ","وَنِسَآءَنَا","وَنِسَآءَكُمْ","وَأَنفُسَنَا","وَأَنفُسَكُمْ","ثُمَّ","نَبْتَهِلْ","فَنَجْعَل","لَّعْنَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَى","ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"hajja-3-66-2","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"prepirali ste se","en":"you (all) argued"},{"bs":"i prepirao se s njim","en":"and he/it argued with him"},{"bs":"prepirao se s tobom","en":"he/it argued with you"},{"bs":"prepiru se s vama","en":"they argue with you (all)"}],"ref":"3:66","answerWord":"حَٰجَجْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/dc174bd0acf946d4d253.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! ye are those who argue about that whereof ye have some knowledge: Why then argue ye concerning that whereof ye have no knowledge? Allah knoweth. Ye know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["هَٰٓأَنتُمْ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","حَٰجَجْتُمْ","فِيمَا","لَكُم","بِهِۦ","عِلْمٌ","فَلِمَ","تُحَآجُّونَ","فِيمَا","لَيْسَ","لَكُم","بِهِۦ","عِلْمٌ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","وَأَنتُمْ","لَا","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"hajja-6-80-0","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"i prepirao se s njim","en":"and he/it argued with him"},{"bs":"prepirali su se s tobom","en":"they argued with you"},{"bs":"prepirao se","en":"he/it argued"},{"bs":"prepirete se","en":"you (all) argue"}],"ref":"6:80","answerWord":"وَحَآجَّهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/664e60e4df7687cd31a4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"His people argued with him. He said: Dispute ye with me concerning Allah when He hath guided me? I fear not at all that which ye set up beside Him unless my Lord willeth aught. My Lord includeth all things in His knowledge. Will ye not then remember?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["وَحَآجَّهُۥ","قَوْمُهُۥ","قَالَ","أَتُحَٰٓجُّوٓنِّى","فِى","ٱللَّهِ","وَقَدْ","هَدَىٰنِ","وَلَآ","أَخَافُ","مَا","تُشْرِكُونَ","بِهِۦٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","يَشَآءَ","رَبِّى","شَيْـًٔا","وَسِعَ","رَبِّى","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","عِلْمًا","أَفَلَا","تَتَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"hajja-6-80-3","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"zar se raspravljate sa mnom?","en":"do you (all) argue with me?"},{"bs":"prepirao se s tobom","en":"he/it argued with you"},{"bs":"prepirete se","en":"you (all) argue"},{"bs":"i prepirao se s njim","en":"and he/it argued with him"}],"ref":"6:80","answerWord":"أَتُحَٰٓجُّوٓنِّى","answerSound":"audio/bc49827e92147d91ae97.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"His people argued with him. He said: Dispute ye with me concerning Allah when He hath guided me? I fear not at all that which ye set up beside Him unless my Lord willeth aught. My Lord includeth all things in His knowledge. Will ye not then remember?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["وَحَآجَّهُۥ","قَوْمُهُۥ","قَالَ","أَتُحَٰٓجُّوٓنِّى","فِى","ٱللَّهِ","وَقَدْ","هَدَىٰنِ","وَلَآ","أَخَافُ","مَا","تُشْرِكُونَ","بِهِۦٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","يَشَآءَ","رَبِّى","شَيْـًٔا","وَسِعَ","رَبِّى","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","عِلْمًا","أَفَلَا","تَتَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"hajja-42-16-1","words":["verb:hajja"],"options":[{"bs":"prepiru se","en":"they argue"},{"bs":"prepirali su se s tobom","en":"they argued with you"},{"bs":"prepirao se","en":"he/it argued"},{"bs":"i prepirao se s njim","en":"and he/it argued with him"}],"ref":"42:16","answerWord":"يُحَآجُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/361f0fc5b56813de939f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who argue concerning Allah after He hath been acknowledged, their argument hath no weight with their Lord, and wrath is upon them and theirs will be an awful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prepirati se, raspravljati","en":"to argue, to dispute"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُحَآجُّونَ","فِى","ٱللَّهِ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","ٱسْتُجِيبَ","لَهُۥ","حُجَّتُهُمْ","دَاحِضَةٌ","عِندَ","رَبِّهِمْ","وَعَلَيْهِمْ","غَضَبٌ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","شَدِيدٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"حاجَّ"}},{"id":"dama-19-31-9","words":["verb:dama"],"options":[{"bs":"budem","en":"I remain"},{"bs":"ostali ste","en":"you (all) remained"},{"bs":"ostali su","en":"they remained"},{"bs":"trajala je","en":"she/it lasted"}],"ref":"19:31","answerWord":"دُمْتُ","answerSound":"audio/3e1e9c6f960b6b103bb1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And hath made me blessed wheresoever I may be, and hath enjoined upon me prayer and almsgiving so long as I remain alive,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trajati, ostati","en":"to last, to remain"},"passage":["وَجَعَلَنِى","مُبَارَكًا","أَيْنَ","مَا","كُنتُ","وَأَوْصَٰنِى","بِٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","وَٱلزَّكَوٰةِ","مَا","دُمْتُ","حَيًّا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"دَامَ"}},{"id":"dama-11-107-3","words":["verb:dama"],"options":[{"bs":"trajala je","en":"she/it lasted"},{"bs":"ostao si","en":"you remained"},{"bs":"ostali ste","en":"you (all) remained"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I remain"}],"ref":"11:107","answerWord":"دَامَتِ","answerSound":"audio/1bd7e419a87e17bb1c6d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Abiding there so long as the heavens and the earth endure save for that which thy Lord willeth. Lo! thy Lord is Doer of what He will.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trajati, ostati","en":"to last, to remain"},"passage":["خَٰلِدِينَ","فِيهَا","مَا","دَامَتِ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتُ","وَٱلْأَرْضُ","إِلَّا","مَا","شَآءَ","رَبُّكَ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","فَعَّالٌ","لِّمَا","يُرِيدُ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"دَامَ"}},{"id":"dama-5-24-7","words":["verb:dama"],"options":[{"bs":"ostali su","en":"they remained"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I remain"},{"bs":"ostao si","en":"you remained"},{"bs":"trajala je","en":"she/it lasted"}],"ref":"5:24","answerWord":"دَامُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/f71c80e5c6a7f946f7c9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: O Moses! We will never enter (the land) while they are in it. So go thou and thy Lord and fight! We will sit here.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trajati, ostati","en":"to last, to remain"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","يَٰمُوسَىٰٓ","إِنَّا","لَن","نَّدْخُلَهَآ","أَبَدًا","مَّا","دَامُوا۟","فِيهَا","فَٱذْهَبْ","أَنتَ","وَرَبُّكَ","فَقَٰتِلَآ","إِنَّا","هَٰهُنَا","قَٰعِدُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"دَامَ"}},{"id":"dama-5-96-13","words":["verb:dama"],"options":[{"bs":"ostali ste","en":"you (all) remained"},{"bs":"budem","en":"I remain"},{"bs":"ostao si","en":"you remained"},{"bs":"trajala je","en":"she/it lasted"}],"ref":"5:96","answerWord":"دُمْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/2661dd9b0ea74f7ecc09.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"To hunt and to eat the fish of the sea is made lawful for you, a provision for you and for seafarers; but to hunt on land is forbidden you so long as ye are on the pilgrimage. Be mindful of your duty to Allah, unto Whom ye will be gathered.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"trajati, ostati","en":"to last, to remain"},"passage":["أُحِلَّ","لَكُمْ","صَيْدُ","ٱلْبَحْرِ","وَطَعَامُهُۥ","مَتَٰعًا","لَّكُمْ","وَلِلسَّيَّارَةِ","وَحُرِّمَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","صَيْدُ","ٱلْبَرِّ","مَا","دُمْتُمْ","حُرُمًا","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","إِلَيْهِ","تُحْشَرُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"دَامَ"}}]